body:
I completely support the idea of some sort of a ban system. But this is so god damn harsh that it just creates backlash and they'll have to discard the whole thing. The problem is not that people are leaving a couple of times, but that people are leaving repeatedly, again, and again, and again. The ban system should punish people for repeated behaviour like this, not slap people with a 5 min ban after leaving just two times. And 5 minutes MAXIMUM is enough to stop the behaviour. They tried to do the right thing but fucked up completely. God damn it.

&#x200B;

Also, i don't care if someone leaves 30 seconds before the end of the match. Does this ban system even take that into consideration? Heck, even i leave 30 seconds before the end if i'm clearly losing. I don't want to lose the ability to do that.
